# Code owners — who is automatically asked to review a pull request.
#
# Pixel Creator is maintained by one person, so a single catch-all rule does the whole job:
# every pull request requests a review from @Sharkou. The more specific rules below exist
# because they document ownership of the areas that must not drift, and because they are
# already correct on the day a second maintainer arrives — at which point the catch-all is
# narrowed rather than rewritten.
#
# Later entries win: the last matching pattern is the one GitHub applies.
#
# This file only routes reviews. Requiring a review before merge is a branch-protection
# setting, not something a file can enforce (see CONTRIBUTING.md).

* @Sharkou

# The read-only archive. Nothing should be committed here at all.
/legacy/ @Sharkou

